d.save('Figure 9.6 Request to transfer activity','UC-04 to UC-09; FR-07 to FR-11; BR-02, BR-11 to BR-16','Action labels identify the responsible role. The right-hand column continues after a confirmed reservation. Required policy decisions gate TR-04. The exception paths release quantities once and notify permitted recipients. An unresolved dispute cannot transfer ownership. RQ-07 is an explicit requester closure, not an automatic AI outcome.')

