d.save('Figure 9.7 Maintenance to end-of-life activity','UC-10, UC-11; FR-12 to FR-14; AI-06; BR-07 to BR-09','Publication and reservation are blocked for unsafe or Not working assets and while AS-04 or AS-06. An increased repair cost needs new approval before completion. Every final end-of-life action requires Sustainability review and Finance write-off. Recycling or disposal records why earlier reuse-first options fail. Retaining an asset rejects the retirement proposal as EL-06 with a reason and restores AS-02 or AS-03. EL-05 and AS-07 to AS-10 apply only to a completed final action.')


